<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="07">
<name>Steering</name>
<section id="1000U_S0017" variety="S0017">
<name>Steering Column</name>
<ttl id="1000U_S0017_746I2_T00CG" variety="T00CG">
<name>Steering Lock System</name>
<para id="RM00000130600GX" category="C" type-id="800Y8" name-id="480YM-00" from="200612">
<dtccode>B2782</dtccode>
<dtcname>Power source ECU malfunction</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM00000130600GX_01" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000A1S00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>A DTC is output when the IGE signal input from the main body ECU (power source ECU) to the steering lock ECU is judged to be abnormal.</ptxt>
<ptxt>Since the steering lock ECU is not connected to CAN communication, responses to outside the steering lock system are made by the certification ECU via LIN communication.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.71in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="2.36in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B2782</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Malfunction in power supply circuit to steering lock</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Wire Harness and Connector</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Main Body ECU</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Steering Lock Actuator</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000130600GX_02" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___0000A1T00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>When using the tool with the IG OFF, connect the tool to the vehicle and repeatedly turn the courtesy switch of any door ON/OFF until communication between the tool and the vehicle starts (ON/OFF interval within 1.5 seconds).</ptxt>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000130600GX_03" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM00000130600GX_03_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___0000A1U00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Steering Lock ECU</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C104383J56" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), with the IG ON and IG OFF, shift lever in P and the door open, inspect the voltage between the terminals of the steering lock actuator.  </ptxt>
</test1>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<table>
<title>Voltage:</title>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.45in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.65in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.03in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>3(IGE) - 1(GND)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>While lock motor is operating</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>1 V or less</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>3(IGE) - 1(GND)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>While lock motor is stopped</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>11 to 14 V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000130600GX_03_0008" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM00000130600GX_03_0002" fin="false">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000130600GX_03_0008" proc-id="RM0550J___0000A1X00000">
<testtitle>Clear DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Clear the DTCs using SST (TaSCAN).</ptxt>
</test1>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000130600GX_03_0004" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000130600GX_03_0004" proc-id="RM0550J___0000A1W00000">
<testtitle>Recheck DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), turn the IG OFF → ON and recheck the DTCs.</ptxt>
</test1>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.89in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" align="center" colwidth="1.24in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry>
<ptxt>Power source ECU malfunction code is not output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry>
<ptxt>Power source ECU malfunction code is output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If there is no malfunction, inspect the wire harness and terminals for problems. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000005D701ZX"/>)</ptxt>
</atten4>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000130600GX_03_0005" fin="true">A</down>
<right ref="RM00000130600GX_03_0007" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000130600GX_03_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___0000A1V00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness and Connector (Main Body ECU - Steering Lock Actuator)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C136603J05" width="2.775699831in" height="3.779676365in"/>
</figure>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect the steering lock actuator connector and connector V of the main body ECU.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check that the connector cases and terminals are not deformed or corroded.  </ptxt>
</test1>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Connector cases and terminals are not deformed or corroded</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the wire harness side connector of the steering lock actuator and wire harness side connector V of the main body ECU.  </ptxt>
</test1>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<table>
<title>Resistance:</title>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.03in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.03in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>3(IGE) - V7(SLR+)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>3 (IGE) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>10 kΩ or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000130600GX_03_0003" fin="true">OK</down>
<right ref="RM00000130600GX_03_0006" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000130600GX_03_0005">
<testtitle>Go to Problem Symptom Simulation Method<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000ABY03DX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000130600GX_03_0003">
<testtitle>Replace main body ECU</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000130600GX_03_0006">
<testtitle>Repair or Replace Wire Harness or Connector</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000130600GX_03_0007">
<testtitle>Replace Steering Lock Actuator Assembly</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>